[
  {
    "id": "chunk-1cc234aac416e7e04684fd84",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 一手文本入口：[《毛泽东选集》第一卷](https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/)\n\n- 版本研究：[《实践论》的版本演变及国际传播](https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html)\n\n- 文本性质：公开著作的短引与结构化转述，不是全文复制。",
    "content_hash": "2d56db9eedb883a7dc89b764ffceb07118e744bb347a8692f0438fb4d0e83a6b",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-9a24c9ac6a9335a2103448f3",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可核验短引",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "《湖南农民运动考察报告》开头交代，作者在五县进行了三十二天实地考察，召集有经验的农民和农运工作者开调查会，并指出现场所得与此前在城市听到的说法“完全相反”。\n\n《实践论》的结论把认识过程概括为：\n\n> “实践、认识、再实践、再认识，这种形式，循环往复以至无穷。”",
    "content_hash": "ac9bc94ed9af02fe4a2059ecce06454c4b287e2179842c156153a254c5fe3e5a",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L11",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-8d0605630ab80ea68c470a99",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可迁移机制",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "这两篇材料共同支持的不是“行动比思考重要”这句常识，而是一个闭环：\n\n1. 先定义需要回答的问题和会受结论影响的人。\n\n2. 进入事实发生的现场，分角色采样，主动寻找与预期相反的材料。\n\n3. 把观察整理成暂时解释，而不是直接当作永久规律。\n\n4. 用小范围、可逆行动检验解释。\n\n5. 优先收集异常、失败和坏消息，再修正解释。",
    "content_hash": "b09046e83f94b91153a3dc7e08f7e18511f458e58aea750c5611cea2fde0446c",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L19",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-17f3f300f6970e07b82b93dc",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "中共中央党史和文献研究院的版本研究说明，《实践论》源自1937年讲课提纲，新中国成立后经过较大内容修改和多次文字处理。现行选集文本适合代表最终公开版本，但不能无说明地当作1937年现场逐字稿。\n\n调查本身也不会自动产生正确判断。样本选择、提问方式、权力在场和既有立场都可能污染材料；因此现代迁移必须增加反证样本、独立记录和可撤回试点。",
    "content_hash": "dd81c9c34f0b2c81a90fd1ae5b45d6132eef442ff2f82648da46c74b60801748",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L29",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-5576dbb05235a1efc02f7ce5",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：反馈完整性",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: feedback-integrity\n\nClaim-Statement: 可用的反馈方法必须把一线证据、暂时判断、可逆试验和独立坏消息通道组成闭环。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 《湖南农民运动考察报告》显示现场材料可以推翻城市转述，《实践论》又要求认识返回实践并继续修正。",
    "content_hash": "7d663395fc0a2fb4b57368acb44dd0e0949bf8bacd5e6cc35ab4ab7c83e6e2c4",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L35",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-98aaf03b81c8d5bba0b8f8b2",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350206068-688bdad9",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：版本与归属",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Claim-Key: version-attribution\n\nClaim-Statement: 历史文本的方法蒸馏必须区分最终公开版本、现场记录和现代推断，不能伪造人物立场。\n\nClaim-Type: principle\n\nEvidence: 《实践论》现行公开文本经过作者后续较大修改和多次文字处理，不能无说明地当作1937年课堂逐字记录。",
    "content_hash": "94cb3162595a560aa69e49e9d2611ea5a4b14bb77e9016819ddaa707f0587f1a",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice#L42",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#investigation-practice",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-d11b087951b3d376447fb401",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 一手文本入口：[《毛泽东选集》第一卷](https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/)\n\n- 核心篇目：《矛盾论》，1937年。\n\n- 文本性质：短引、概念关系和现代使用边界。",
    "content_hash": "2ed859ea4b3de1b70d56b62a026034aca95d31c3ff10811785afe36f4ccf36be",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-27a96127971aa9bad0205f1d",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可核验短引",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "《矛盾论》讨论复杂过程中的多重矛盾时写道：\n\n> “其中必定有一种是主要的，起着领导的、决定的作用，其他则处于次要和服从的地位。”\n\n同一篇文本反复强调具体分析矛盾的特殊性，不能把在一种场景有效的处理方式机械套到另一种场景。",
    "content_hash": "68e601400c5fc57051d022c8569dac156c2c016d171afc2fc2fb51847d989c76",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L11",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-aa70cb1261803b00664742a5",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可迁移机制",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "现代问题不应先给人贴“敌友”或阶级标签，而应把矛盾改写为可观察的关系：\n\n1. 列出目标、资源、事实、流程和价值上的冲突。\n\n2. 区分冲突性质：信息不足、目标不一致、资源约束、制度摩擦或权利冲突。\n\n3. 提出两个以上可能的“主要矛盾”，为每个解释列证据和反证。\n\n4. 选择当前最能牵动其他问题、又能通过可逆行动验证的一项。\n\n5. 写明重新排序条件；主要矛盾是阶段假设，不是永久身份。",
    "content_hash": "f31b9b5ed4e3dff98ffebd25e1d1aad95c966605ec0fdcaa5becbc6aa4bda7e2",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L19",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-a3f95b5268490347275a9824",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "“抓主要矛盾”容易制造过度压缩。复杂系统可能同时存在多个不可互相约减的目标，解决一个瓶颈也可能把风险转移给弱势群体。现代使用时必须保留备选解释、独立复核、申辩和改判机制。\n\n本方法不能用于把同事、客户、社会群体或异议者敌人化，也不能把普通意见分歧升级为需要“斗争”的人格判断。",
    "content_hash": "1a33220c33bea2b4667638c7f1bb297ae29516e69d7af9dd1b885cf6883942ae",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L29",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-85c204030400b5bfb3ff7b3d",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：阶段性分类",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: contradiction-reclassification\n\nClaim-Statement: 矛盾排序必须是可改判的阶段假设，并禁止把普通分歧转化为敌我身份。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 《矛盾论》要求具体分析矛盾的特殊性、主次和条件转化，因此“主要矛盾”不能成为脱离新证据的永久标签。",
    "content_hash": "332cd34091084cf810a23e588b8ec194baa4533cf86aacdb049929d506d4bf01",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L35",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-d3650094ec52776d0b862ae3",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350213918-6f5052ba",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：现代迁移边界",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Claim-Key: rights-bound-transfer\n\nClaim-Statement: 历史方法的现代迁移必须以非暴力、守法、可逆、保留申辩和复核为硬边界。\n\nClaim-Type: principle\n\nEvidence: 普通组织中的意见分歧不能沿用战争和敌我分类，排序工具必须服从法律、安全与基本权利。",
    "content_hash": "585ef4bffc27bbe6e608bf3dce6314ef3f09d939b90704de7a35d2b64d190572",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction#L42",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/dyj/#on-contradiction",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-6eb06f82e0b2d87ef29529ae",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 一手文本入口：[《毛泽东选集》第三卷](https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/)\n\n- 核心篇目：《关于领导方法的若干问题》，1943年。\n\n- 文本性质：短引与工作流程重构。",
    "content_hash": "3c6639691d69f20e8a95f87bbe384759391a282f4a4ff5f4d175802e493b2095",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-ef27657e9819d5baaae2ec04",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可核验短引",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "该文将正确领导的方法概括为：\n\n> “从群众中来，到群众中去。”\n\n原文所描述的完整过程并不止于“听取意见”：先把群众中分散的、不系统的意见集中起来，经过研究形成集中的、系统的意见，再回到群众中宣传解释、在行动中检验，然后继续循环。",
    "content_hash": "c67f08a89a143242a737c589d50d2fd4dd9cecebf5bcd38fe8f0c56cda89c729",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L11",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-31afc4f8841fc0bb7d15abbf",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可迁移机制",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "在产品、组织或公共参与中，可以安全转译为反馈闭环：\n\n1. 从直接受影响者和一线执行者处采集具体经历，不只收集满意度。\n\n2. 区分事实观察、个人诉求、价值冲突和解决方案建议。\n\n3. 保留少数意见，说明样本覆盖和代表性限制。\n\n4. 将共性问题转化为一个范围有限、责任清楚的试行方案。\n\n5. 把方案带回参与者处验证，公开说明采纳、未采纳及原因。\n\n6. 根据执行结果修订，不把一次动员或多数意见当成永久授权。",
    "content_hash": "08cf28c5fb36b3c9d4455c0fdaefc2c20b24d7fe7ee3c771086e556279e761d8",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L19",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-eae28d2e05a17c0ccefac8a0",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "“群众”不是同质整体。声量最大者不一定最受影响，多数意见也不能取消少数人的基本权利。现代迁移必须提供安全反馈、知情参与、退出、申诉和独立复核机制。\n\n若组织者预先规定唯一正确答案，反馈循环会退化成确认结论的仪式。此时应停止使用“群众路线”称呼，先修复信息和权力结构。",
    "content_hash": "1fde6e92f7028a738138e0c5fa2c2a276bd4a3ba7962055f91949a6b5ad44a22",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L30",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-3beab0f1ef66564c561cb64a",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：反馈完整性",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: feedback-integrity\n\nClaim-Statement: 可用的反馈方法必须把一线证据、暂时判断、可逆试验和独立坏消息通道组成闭环。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 《关于领导方法的若干问题》描述从分散经验到系统意见、返回行动检验并继续循环的过程，不能只保留“集中意见”一步。",
    "content_hash": "c2509c3aa5365222a87f2606966bf0c55ecb7d73595e9e04cb930a48aa84033e",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L36",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-a77970782182126b084c1496",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350219239-010e890c",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：现代迁移边界",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Claim-Key: rights-bound-transfer\n\nClaim-Statement: 历史方法的现代迁移必须以非暴力、守法、可逆、保留申辩和复核为硬边界。\n\nClaim-Type: principle\n\nEvidence: “群众”并非同质整体，现代反馈必须保护少数意见，并提供知情参与、退出、申诉和独立复核。",
    "content_hash": "8e74f1080e85ab6529f82a05af979bac95af3cf29e026e1c2b61f7953cada535",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods#L43",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d3j/#leadership-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-e19ee6ea929e5dd8c8ee64df",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350224793-95c27426",
    "document_version": 1,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 一手文本入口：[《毛泽东选集》第四卷](https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/)\n\n- 核心篇目：《党委会的工作方法》，1949年；相关阶段方法来自持久战与集中力量的公开文本。\n\n- 文本性质：工作方法转述，不复制军事操作。",
    "content_hash": "4b350f65833fa377b220c560769369541db5219bda8e65fedee685073abc760f",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-affc24b4c9c64c7e8b9ebcf9",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350224793-95c27426",
    "document_version": 1,
    "section_path": "可核验结构",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "《党委会的工作方法》把集体领导写成一组具体工作规则，包括书记善于当“班长”、把问题摆到桌面、互通情报、不懂就问、抓紧中心工作并兼顾其他工作。文中“弹钢琴”的比喻强调十个指头都要动作，但要有节奏和配合。\n\n相关战略文本还区分长期阶段与具体行动：总体方向可以长期推进，但局部行动需要有限目标、准备和反馈。",
    "content_hash": "f3f02c01bbffb32812483b7c6fc69d3822cb85a196f32268453dc38e0e572410",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods#L11",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-89409742660ef95b15fdc882",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350224793-95c27426",
    "document_version": 1,
    "section_path": "可迁移机制",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "现代组织可使用以下非军事版本：\n\n1. 先明确当前阶段：探索、验证、扩展或收缩。\n\n2. 选择一个窄目标集中资源，同时写明不能牺牲的安全和权利约束。\n\n3. 把目标拆成短周期、可逆试点，不用一次全面推广证明决心。\n\n4. 会议中把事实、异议和未知项摆到桌面，指定独立核验者。\n\n5. 让决策、执行和复核至少在角色上可区分。\n\n6. 预先定义停止、回滚和阶段切换条件。",
    "content_hash": "e74b776da2f034e3ce4560845d9f689b1541083ac29e2e69b05f81a2bc338a8d",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods#L17",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-954d8df53898586700d6febf",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350224793-95c27426",
    "document_version": 1,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "战争中的集中、保密和命令逻辑不能直接迁移到普通公司、家庭、学校、社区或公共治理。现代组织中的参与者拥有法律、合同和基本权利，不是可被“歼灭”“孤立”或工具化的对象。\n\n局部集中也不是永远只做一件事。安全、合规、现金流和人员健康等约束可能必须并行维护；“中心工作”不能成为忽视系统性风险的借口。",
    "content_hash": "4cbe2668ac59421a16df01fa660cc1e0a09fd8335b8b57a816a29a8e5ac479da",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods#L28",
    "source_key": "https://www.12371.cn/special/mzdxj/d4j/#committee-methods",
    "independence_group": "mao-authorized-works",
    "authority": "primary",
    "source_role": "evidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-1c11165d3ceb540cad754df9",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 官方文本：[《关于建国以来党的若干历史问题的决议》](https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm)\n\n- 通过时间：1981年6月27日。\n\n- 证据角色：反证与历史边界，不作为毛泽东本人自述。",
    "content_hash": "de06e0685754a5cadb30eb678fdaa76a3ea0a31cbd301137ee1249120c724348",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-7924502f5a6832ab4cf70a4c",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "决议明确记录的失效",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "决议第20段指出，“文化大革命”对当时阶级形势和党政状况的估计“是完全错误的”，并具体记录了是非与敌我的混淆、知识分子和干部受到打击、党政组织受到冲击等后果。\n\n关于以群众名义发动运动，决议写道：\n\n> “名义上是直接依靠群众，实际上既脱离了党的组织，又脱离了广大群众。”\n\n第22段明确认为毛泽东对这场全局性、长时间的严重错误负有主要责任。第24段又把持续失效与个人专断、集体领导和民主集中制受损、法律和制度化不足联系起来。",
    "content_hash": "07ccdf0c90039fbd6cc59a49ec81eb900c805055d21383bd3a73272505c4c2eb",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L11",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-7980077d9de4fede9c356696",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "对方法迁移的硬约束",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "这些材料表明，方法论文本中的“调查、群众、矛盾、纠错”不会自动约束实际权力。只要出现以下条件，就应停止套用历史框架：\n\n1. 批评者会因提供坏消息遭受身份或职业惩罚。\n\n2. 一个人或单一机构同时控制分类、决策、执行和复核。\n\n3. 普通分歧被改写为敌我身份。\n\n4. 大规模动员替代事实、法律程序和个体同意。\n\n5. 试点没有退出、申诉、回滚和责任追究机制。",
    "content_hash": "247d7d534c2f2247b096f4aec7c9d5d0e167fe6c1dec982b2a6e1fe0ffd959c9",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L21",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-ff8094d5b00a0a1cf3bf32e3",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "该决议是中共中央的正式历史结论，既有高文本权威，也承担特定政治和组织功能。它能证明官方结论与制度反思，不能单独穷尽所有历史因果；具体事实仍需档案和独立研究交叉验证。",
    "content_hash": "777b02f10f6d8311695817a50965ab09814d840476f09dc59d70bc94f8dbefab",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L31",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-30e6624e3d29607d206df8b7",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：反馈完整性",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: feedback-integrity\n\nClaim-Statement: 可用的反馈方法必须把一线证据、暂时判断、可逆试验和独立坏消息通道组成闭环。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 决议把个人专断、集体领导受损和民主法制制度化不足列入持续失效原因，表明理念上的调查不能替代独立反馈制度。",
    "content_hash": "ac1ebf45db02bccfdefaadb42b1bd2d7b427ae55e106560cb6be45e4bcfbfd23",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L35",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-25dd75628dce6dd0698e58db",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：阶段性分类",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Claim-Key: contradiction-reclassification\n\nClaim-Statement: 矛盾排序必须是可改判的阶段假设，并禁止把普通分歧转化为敌我身份。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 决议明确记录文化大革命中是非与敌我的混淆，以及错误分类给干部、知识分子和社会组织造成的严重后果。",
    "content_hash": "fe453e315348a29b80f19f615846b0717d71486d63c48cb99a5a4fca7d312a68",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L42",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-d36fc7650fb104da05294171",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350230666-aaa795cd",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：现代迁移边界",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "text": "Claim-Key: rights-bound-transfer\n\nClaim-Statement: 历史方法的现代迁移必须以非暴力、守法、可逆、保留申辩和复核为硬边界。\n\nClaim-Type: principle\n\nEvidence: 决议指出问题应以符合宪法、法律和党章的措施解决，不能采用文化大革命的理论和方法。",
    "content_hash": "add94840d00ade7e0da06144c69c5aa8a91c09e5cb1d91aa70a9e95a2bcf8e2c",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm#L49",
    "source_key": "https://www.gov.cn/test/2008-06/23/content_1024934_3.htm",
    "independence_group": "1981-central-resolution",
    "authority": "official",
    "source_role": "counterevidence"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-b7110862929158db7ba4f956",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350236079-81ffe900",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 论文：[The Institutional Causes of China's Great Famine](https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361)\n\n- 作者：Xin Meng、Nancy Qian、Pierre Yared。\n\n- NBER Working Paper 16361，2010年9月，DOI `10.3386/w16361`。\n\n- 证据角色：独立学术机制研究，用于验证信息反馈失灵的边界。",
    "content_hash": "153abed1a54053812366f89266e2efe8c735fe40beb0fac12c4d79a4ac1d7f96",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361",
    "independence_group": "nber-meng-qian-yared",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "verification_anchor"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-0eac0606cebaed4999dca05c",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350236079-81ffe900",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "摘要层面的可核验结论",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "论文摘要报告两个经验发现：饥荒开始的1959年，总体粮食产量仍显著高于人口生存需要；当年人均粮食产量较高的地区反而经历更高的饥荒死亡率。作者提出的制度模型认为，这些模式与中央计划体制在总产量冲击下无法容易收集并响应新信息的情形一致。",
    "content_hash": "d8e52735e86669d59460a6c913a7b82478be8b634e11fb8e277f24d15f975577",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361#L12",
    "source_key": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361",
    "independence_group": "nber-meng-qian-yared",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "verification_anchor"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-c8c6a8e619ea5ae5db45492b",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350236079-81ffe900",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "对 Skill 的意义",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "这项研究不直接评价某一句方法论文本，而是提供一个独立的系统反例：\n\n- 总量充足不等于分配和响应有效。\n\n- 中央知道“总体数据”不等于知道局部冲击。\n\n- 上报、征收和激励结构可能让更高产地区承担更严重后果。\n\n- 纠错不能只依赖领导者愿意调查，还需要信息可安全上行、地方异常可被看见、政策可及时调整。\n\n因此，任何“调查—集中—执行”的现代流程都必须加入：\n\n1. 独立于执行链的异常监测。\n\n2. 对分布而非只对总量的检查。\n\n3. 坏消息保护和升级路径。\n\n4. 明确的暂停、回滚和责任机制。",
    "content_hash": "58ae9519e6a8e7721d8938cedf88e2fe92ccdc8d4e43d2cceeed5f7981bb4276",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361#L16",
    "source_key": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361",
    "independence_group": "nber-meng-qian-yared",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "verification_anchor"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-83b15c13912c687ed258d889",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350236079-81ffe900",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "证据边界",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "工作论文使用模型和历史数据解释制度机制，不应被简化为单因果结论。它与官方历史决议的证据类型、作者群和制度位置不同，二者共同使用能够降低单一叙事偏差。",
    "content_hash": "af7d4a4512805cb9b9e4c8a05e9695aefcf963ff37d3f69f8582a65f1a61af1c",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361#L32",
    "source_key": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361",
    "independence_group": "nber-meng-qian-yared",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "verification_anchor"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-2a94910a6c94447568df2c83",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350236079-81ffe900",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：反馈完整性",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: feedback-integrity\n\nClaim-Statement: 可用的反馈方法必须把一线证据、暂时判断、可逆试验和独立坏消息通道组成闭环。\n\nClaim-Type: framework\n\nEvidence: 论文的制度模型把异常结果与中央计划体制难以及时收集并响应新信息联系起来，说明总量信息和领导意愿不能替代分布监测与独立上行通道。",
    "content_hash": "ee667f979c15b568be221171fb129d20f9181d2d3a679faf226db1581302eb77",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361#L36",
    "source_key": "https://www.nber.org/papers/w16361",
    "independence_group": "nber-meng-qian-yared",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "verification_anchor"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-1c0f7925a3e02e080fc101c0",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350243000-2205bc65",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "来源定位",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "- 研究：[《实践论》的版本演变及国际传播](https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html)\n\n- 作者：龚格格。\n\n- 发布机构：中共中央党史和文献研究院，2021年1月18日。\n\n- 证据角色：版本学背景和引用纪律。",
    "content_hash": "e1604245512a71b386e82ff14b4e8c24be02eae9541dd91d343bb5ae9c19571e",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html#L5",
    "source_key": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html",
    "independence_group": "party-history-institute-version-study",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "context"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-6c99c5f5ad1d359cd84a2fca",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350243000-2205bc65",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "可核验结论",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "该研究说明，《实践论》源自1937年毛泽东在延安讲授哲学课程的提纲。新中国成立后，毛泽东对相关章节做过较大的内容修改、完善，并有多次细微文字处理；独立成篇后的文本又经历不同出版版本。\n\n研究同时指出，早期讲授提纲存在未署名版本，后来署名和单行本的形成有具体出版过程。现行文本适合代表经过作者修改的公开表达，但不宜被描述成1937年课堂现场的逐字记录。",
    "content_hash": "28c45ead5926a1dfb1273679cd959294e3dacf6ade1212c7898b5e8c45813242",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html#L12",
    "source_key": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html",
    "independence_group": "party-history-institute-version-study",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "context"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-1ac63ee028706d2c74912488",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350243000-2205bc65",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "对蒸馏的约束",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "1. 每条直接引语必须附篇名、版本入口和文本性质。\n\n2. “作者说过”与“后人从作者文本推导”必须分开。\n\n3. 公开定稿可以支持最终观点，不能自动证明某年当场的原始措辞。\n\n4. 讲话整理稿、集体文件、编辑题注和个人手稿不能给予相同证据等级。\n\n5. 当不同版本影响方法含义时，应并列版本，不选择更方便当前论证的一版。",
    "content_hash": "90935944625701fedec1d91b54ba5c289895075a3d28302466fcf6971e5cd38c",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html#L18",
    "source_key": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html",
    "independence_group": "party-history-institute-version-study",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "context"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-1984d75a8087f0c8f807d3e8",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350243000-2205bc65",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "现代输出纪律",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "最终 Skill 不使用第一人称冒充历史人物，也不生成伪造语录。面对毛泽东没有讨论过的现代问题，只能说“这是基于公开方法的现代迁移”，并给出迁移在哪些条件下会失效。",
    "content_hash": "b3613791739f67d9d6831f7ea1cb3b37197e36c1c859b8bc19b3d7c2f953dc1b",
    "access_level": "public",
    "source_locator": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html#L26",
    "source_key": "https://www.dswxyjy.org.cn/n1/2021/0118/c219000-32003108.html",
    "independence_group": "party-history-institute-version-study",
    "authority": "scholarly",
    "source_role": "context"
  },
  {
    "id": "chunk-b1e39c7b210c485e63f86dfc",
    "document_id": "document-20260806164350243000-2205bc65",
    "document_version": 2,
    "section_path": "结构化主张：版本与归属",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "Claim-Key: version-attribution\n\nClaim-Statement: 历史文本的方法蒸馏必须区分最终公开版本、现场记录和现代推断，不能伪造人物立场。\n\nClaim-Type: principle\n\nEvidence: 版本研究记录《实践论》从讲授提纲到独立成篇及多次修改的过程，证明文本版本本身是解释和引用不可省略的证据。",
    "content_hash": "175f07915f6b738b62527535f79359999884e9a127c8de24c6ed11bf509662af",
